  "notes": "FORMS:\n{送|そう} (to send) + {電|でん} (electricity). Literally 'sending electricity.'\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {送電線|そうでんせん} (power line, transmission line)\n- {送電|そうでん}を{止|と}める (to stop power transmission)\n- {送電|そうでん}{鉄塔|てっとう} (transmission tower, pylon)\n- {送電|そうでん}ロス (transmission loss)\n- {送電|そうでん}{網|もう} (power grid)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {配電|はいでん}: power distribution — the final stage of delivering electricity to consumers\n- {発電|はつでん}: power generation — producing electricity",
